stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    
    Input: Pseudorandom Data Input
    Encoder: Encoder Block
    Mapping: Mapping Layer
    Decoder: Decoder Block
    Output: Text Output
    RL: RL Agent
    
    Input --> Encoder
    Encoder --> Mapping
    Mapping --> Decoder
    Decoder --> Output
    
    Output --> RL
    RL --> Mapping: Update Weights
    
    note right of Mapping
        Learns correlation between
        pseudorandom patterns
        and text embeddings
    end note
    
    note right of RL
        Reinforcement learning loop:
        - Evaluates output quality
        - Updates mapping weights
        - Optimizes for text accuracy
    end note
